	"Description": "增加94件烘焙屋家具和11件小狗装饰，使用FF3.0（Furniture Framework）前置。 可选文件（Optional files）中附带一个可作为搭配的PIF房间。\n<br />\n<br />\u00A0mod分为中文版和英文版，在main files中选择需要的语言版本下载。\u00A0\n<br />\n<br />下载完前置及mod文件后，在罗宾的木匠商店 或者游戏原有的家具目录中获取烘焙屋和小狗主题家具目录。\u00A0\n<br />若同时下载了烘焙屋PIF房间，可将装饰门放置在墙上，交互后选择烘焙屋并进入房间。\n<br />\n<br />我的小红书账号：韭菜炖大鹅 \n<br />\n<br />=======================================================================\n<br />\n<br />Adds 94 bakery themed furniture items and 11 puppy themed decorations. Requires FF 3.0(Furniture Framework) as a prerequisite. The Optional files include a matching PIF room.\u00A0\n<br />\n<br />The mod is available in Chinese and English versions; choose the language version you need in the main files.\u00A0\n<br />\n<br />After downloading the prerequisite and the mod files, you can obtain the bakery themed and puppy themed furniture catalogues from Robin's Carpenter Shop or from the game's original Furniture Catalogue.\n<br />\u00A0If you also download the Bakery PIF room, you can place the decorative door on the wall, interact with it, select Bakery, and enter the room. \n<br />\n<br />My Social Media:\n<br />Xiaohongshu (Little Red Book): 韭菜炖大鹅 ",
